**Claim 1.**

A system for providing video to a viewer terminal through a communication network, the system comprising:

a receiving unit configured to receive an original video via the communication network;

a delay unit configured to generate a delayed version of the original video by applying a time delay to the received original video;

a subtitle interface configured to exchange subtitle data with a subtitler terminal over the communication network, the subtitle data being generated in association with the original video; and

a transmitting unit configured to transmit, to the viewer terminal via the communication network, the delayed version of the original video together with timing information, the timing information being adapted to synchronize the subtitle data with the delayed version of the original video at the viewer terminal.
